WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.563
Module 2: assessing the forest.

2
00:00:02.563 --> 00:00:05.437
Chapter 07 ends with a gap list.

3
00:00:05.437 --> 00:00:09.732
Chapter 08 fills it with the
privileged half of discovery:

4
00:00:09.732 --> 00:00:15.100
the configuration partition, ACLs on
OUs, every GPO's settings, DNS server

5
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.857
configuration, the PKI
containers and CA settings,

6
00:00:18.857 --> 00:00:21.988
and the delegation flags on every account.

7
00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:24.890
The program's position is
that the assessment is

8
00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.938
an evidence-producing process,
not a set of scripts.

9
00:00:27.938 --> 00:00:33.191
Every run collects a fixed set of
artifacts into a fixed directory layout,

10
00:00:33.191 --> 00:00:36.721
writes a manifest with a
SHA-256 hash of every file,

11
00:00:36.721 --> 00:00:40.338
and commits the run to the
program's Git repository.

12
00:00:40.338 --> 00:00:44.798
Appendix B carries the complete
module, restored and corrected;

13
00:00:44.798 --> 00:00:47.980
Appendix C carries the
identity-side module.
